000100*================================================================
000200* ACCTXFER - INTERBANK FUNDS TRANSFER, NIGHTLY BATCH
000300*
000400* !!! INTENTIONALLY VULNERABLE - DO NOT USE IN PRODUCTION !!!
000500* Demo material for Watchtower, the Alcazar static analyzer.
000600* Every flaw in this program is deliberate; the fixed version is
000700* examples/hardened/ACCTXFER.cbl.
000800*
000900* Planted flaws: sign-loss MOVE, truncation, a dynamic CALL chosen
001000* by input, CALL "SYSTEM" with record data, a hard-coded password,
001100* PAN on SYSOUT, no FILE STATUS, unchecked LINE SEQUENTIAL splits,
001200* ALTER, a condition beyond column 72, and fee and FX arithmetic
001300* with no ON SIZE ERROR and no ROUNDED (a zero-rate division too).
001400*================================================================
001500 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001600 PROGRAM-ID. ACCTXFER.
001700 AUTHOR. ALCAZAR DEMO.
001800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002000 FILE-CONTROL.
002100     SELECT XFER-IN ASSIGN TO "XFERIN.DAT"
002200         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
002300         FILE STATUS IS WS-XFER-FS.
002400     SELECT XFER-LOG ASSIGN TO "XFERLOG.DAT"
002500         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
002600 DATA DIVISION.
002700 FILE SECTION.
002800 FD  XFER-IN.
002900 01  XFER-IN-REC.
003000     05  IN-FROM-ACCT            PIC X(12).
003100     05  IN-TO-ACCT              PIC X(12).
003200     05  IN-CARD-PAN             PIC X(16).
003300     05  IN-AMOUNT               PIC S9(9)V99
003400                                 SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
003500     05  IN-BENEF-NAME           PIC X(40).
003600     05  IN-ROUTE-CODE           PIC X(8).
003700 FD  XFER-LOG.
003800 01  XFER-LOG-REC                PIC X(132).
003900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004000 01  WS-XFER-FS                  PIC XX.
004100     88  XFER-OK                 VALUE "00".
004200     88  XFER-EOF                VALUE "10".
004300 01  WS-DB-USER                  PIC X(8)  VALUE "XFERBAT".
004400 01  WS-DB-PASSWORD              PIC X(16) VALUE "Tr3asury#2019".
004500 01  WS-FRAUD-PGM                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FRAUDCHK".
004600 01  WS-FRAUD-RC                 PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
004700 01  WS-SHELL-CMD                PIC X(200).
004800 01  WS-XFER-AMT                 PIC S9(9)V99.
004900 01  WS-POSTED-AMT               PIC 9(9)V99.
005000 01  WS-AUDIT-AMT                PIC S9(5)V99.
005100 01  WS-FEE-AMT                  PIC S9(5)V99.
005200 01  WS-FX-RATE                  PIC 9(3)V9(6) VALUE 1.
005300 01  WS-FX-AMT                   PIC S9(9)V99.
005400 01  WS-DAILY-LIMIT              PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE 10000.00.
005500 01  WS-WATCHLIST-HIT            PIC X VALUE "N".
005600 01  WS-BENEF-SHORT              PIC X(20).
005700 01  WS-XFER-COUNT               PIC 9(7) COMP VALUE 0.
005800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005900 0000-MAIN.
006000     CALL "DBCONNECT" USING WS-DB-USER WS-DB-PASSWORD
006100     OPEN INPUT XFER-IN
006200     OPEN EXTEND XFER-LOG
006300     PERFORM 1000-READ-NEXT
006400     PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-TRANSFER UNTIL XFER-EOF
006500     CLOSE XFER-IN XFER-LOG
006600     STOP RUN.
006700
006800 1000-READ-NEXT.
006900*    Only "00" and "10" are expected: an over-long line comes back
007000*    as two records, the second one fully attacker-controlled.
007100     READ XFER-IN
007200         AT END SET XFER-EOF TO TRUE
007300     END-READ.
007400
007500 2000-PROCESS-TRANSFER.
007600     ADD 1 TO WS-XFER-COUNT
007700     MOVE IN-AMOUNT TO WS-XFER-AMT
007800*    Debits arrive as negative amounts.
007900     MOVE WS-XFER-AMT TO WS-POSTED-AMT
008000     MOVE WS-XFER-AMT TO WS-AUDIT-AMT
008100     MOVE IN-BENEF-NAME TO WS-BENEF-SHORT
008200*    Fee: 0.25 percent, cut to the cent.
008300     COMPUTE WS-FEE-AMT = WS-XFER-AMT * 0.0025
008400     COMPUTE WS-FX-AMT = WS-XFER-AMT / WS-FX-RATE
008500     IF WS-XFER-AMT > WS-DAILY-LIMIT                              OR WS-WATCHLIST-HIT = "Y"
008600         PERFORM 8000-REJECT-TRANSFER
008700     END-IF
008800*    The next comment has no "-- reason": Watchtower ignores it,
008900*    an unjustified suppression never hides a finding.
009000* watchtower-ignore ALZ-COB-005
009100     DISPLAY "XFER " IN-FROM-ACCT " CARD " IN-CARD-PAN
009200             " AMT " WS-XFER-AMT
009300*    The fraud check module is picked by the routing code.
009400     MOVE IN-ROUTE-CODE TO WS-FRAUD-PGM
009500     CALL WS-FRAUD-PGM USING XFER-IN-REC WS-FRAUD-RC
009600     IF IN-ROUTE-CODE = "PRIORITY"
009700         ALTER 3000-ROUTE TO PROCEED TO 3200-PRIORITY-ROUTE
009800     END-IF
009900     PERFORM 3000-ROUTE THRU 3999-ROUTE-EXIT
010000     STRING "notify-ops.sh " DELIMITED BY SIZE
010100            IN-BENEF-NAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
010200            INTO WS-SHELL-CMD
010300     END-STRING
010400     CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-SHELL-CMD
010500     PERFORM 1000-READ-NEXT.
010600
010700 3000-ROUTE.
010800     GO TO 3100-STANDARD-ROUTE.
010900
011000 3100-STANDARD-ROUTE.
011100     MOVE WS-BENEF-SHORT TO XFER-LOG-REC
011200     WRITE XFER-LOG-REC
011300     GO TO 3999-ROUTE-EXIT.
011400
011500 3200-PRIORITY-ROUTE.
011600     MOVE "PRIORITY" TO XFER-LOG-REC
011700     WRITE XFER-LOG-REC
011800     GO TO 3999-ROUTE-EXIT.
011900
012000 3999-ROUTE-EXIT.
012100     EXIT.
012200
012300 8000-REJECT-TRANSFER.
012400     MOVE "REJECTED: LIMIT" TO XFER-LOG-REC
012500     WRITE XFER-LOG-REC.
